- turn.php remains the entry-point bootstrap (instantiates controller, passes HttpClient with timeouts)
- AgentProxyController.streamSidecarResponse() handles all SSE detection and header management
- Non-SSE responses (Content-Type: application/json) continue to work via existing code path

